{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-08-25 20:56:00', 'title': "CENTENE STATEMENT RE: CALIFORNIA'S MEDI-CAL MANAGED CARE CONTRACT AWARD", 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , AUG. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ISSUED THE FOLLOWING STATEMENT AFTER THE ANNOUNCEMENT OF THE AWARD OF THE MEDI-CAL MANAGED CARE CONTRACTS: "AS ONE OF THE STATE\'S LONGEST SERVING AND MOST EXPERIENCED MEDI-CAL PARTNERS, WE ARE PLEASED TO HAVE BEEN AWARDED CONTRACTS BY THE CALIFORNIA DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH CARE SERVICES TO CONTINUE SERVING MEMBERS IN NINE COUNTIES ACROSS CALIFORNIA." "HOWEVER, WE ARE DISAPPOINTED TO LEARN THE STATE HAS CHOSEN NOT TO AWARD US CONTRACTS IN LOS ANGELES, SACRAMENTO AND KERN COUNTIES.'}